// What this engine alone decides about an SO-101. Its limbs, joints, camera
// and start posture come from the robot's description, through
// sim_robot_core's entry of the same name, and its MuJoCo model from the
// release of Waldo's catalogue the base image bakes: MuJoCo Menagerie's
// robotstudio_so101, driven by upstream's STS3215 servo model, so the servos
// hold the arm against gravity as the real ones do.
{
  // The arm works against a floor: upstream stands it on one, and a jaw
  // closing on the floor pushes against it.
  floor: true,
}
